    "selected": [
      {
        "id": "a97b6021c6e8dc05",
        "description": "Weeping with joy, he embraced Benjamin. Then Joseph kissed each of his brothers and wept over them. After that the brothers began talking freely with him. – Slide 17",
        "imageUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Joseph_Reunion/source-jpeg/17_FB_Joseph_Reunion_1024.jpg?1724236423",
        "thumbnailUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Joseph_Reunion/overview-thumbnails/17_FB_Joseph_Reunion_Thumbnail.jpg?1724236423",
        "path": "docs/illustrations/sabedoria-kids/joseph-reunion/17.jpg",
        "sourceScene": 17,
        "sha256": "73baf9c64af0b0f74ef5b1a73ff26992704b36472878bd6a59a5a359b19f5323"
      },
      {
        "id": "69d0d3707e95443e",
        "description": "‘I am Joseph, your brother, whom you sold as a slave,’ he announced. The shocked brothers were speechless. – Slide 14",
        "imageUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Joseph_Reunion/source-jpeg/14_FB_Joseph_Reunion_1024.jpg?1724236423",
        "thumbnailUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Joseph_Reunion/overview-thumbnails/14_FB_Joseph_Reunion_Thumbnail.jpg?1724236423",
        "path": "docs/illustrations/sabedoria-kids/joseph-reunion/14.jpg",
        "sourceScene": 14,
        "sha256": "17395dbfcfa3e531211f115a84fefc82cac2c6d37497d95191d45112680a323f"
      },
      {
        "id": "8ffd56437af7a93e",
        "description": "‘Don’t be upset, or angry with yourselves. It was God who sent me here ahead of you to preserve your lives. This famine that has ravaged the land for two years will last five more years. God made me an adviser to Pharaoh and the governor of all Egypt. – Slide 15",
        "imageUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Joseph_Reunion/source-jpeg/15_FB_Joseph_Reunion_1024.jpg?1724236423",
        "thumbnailUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Joseph_Reunion/overview-thumbnails/15_FB_Joseph_Reunion_Thumbnail.jpg?1724236423",
        "path": "docs/illustrations/sabedoria-kids/joseph-reunion/15.jpg",
        "sourceScene": 15,
        "sha256": "d6c4504db3c24e12a9e2afebce00be820e335018f7c4eb54f0d3b763d9b5bc24"
      },
      {
        "id": "8f08204fc92c9fa2",
        "description": "Joseph could bear it no longer. He asked his servants to leave so he could be alone with his brothers. – Slide 12",
        "imageUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Joseph_Reunion/source-jpeg/12_FB_Joseph_Reunion_1024.jpg?1724236423",
        "thumbnailUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Joseph_Reunion/overview-thumbnails/12_FB_Joseph_Reunion_Thumbnail.jpg?1724236423",
        "path": "docs/illustrations/sabedoria-kids/joseph-reunion/12.jpg",
        "sourceScene": 12,
        "sha256": "16de15b80ccabc55dabf52756781a9d0185045682adbad2c2e8c8b068d96a559"
      },
      {
        "id": "66e61ec348bd82f1",
        "description": "‘Now hurry back to my father and tell him. Bring him to Egypt and you can all live in Goshen where you can be near me. Otherwise you will all starve.’ – Slide 16",
        "imageUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Joseph_Reunion/source-jpeg/16_FB_Joseph_Reunion_1024.jpg?1724236423",
        "thumbnailUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Joseph_Reunion/overview-thumbnails/16_FB_Joseph_Reunion_Thumbnail.jpg?1724236423",
        "path": "docs/illustrations/sabedoria-kids/joseph-reunion/16.jpg",
        "sourceScene": 16,
        "sha256": "d3e123e38add9dc7fb481b1790fc6ae31e0d6ff702a269e7c29236f9394e1a57"
      },
      {
        "id": "0003c55c4a29e94d",
        "description": "Then he broke down and wept. He wept so loudly the Egyptians could hear him, and reported it to Pharaoh. – Slide 13",
        "imageUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Joseph_Reunion/source-jpeg/13_FB_Joseph_Reunion_1024.jpg?1724236423",
        "thumbnailUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Joseph_Reunion/overview-thumbnails/13_FB_Joseph_Reunion_Thumbnail.jpg?1724236423",
        "path": "docs/illustrations/sabedoria-kids/joseph-reunion/13.jpg",
        "sourceScene": 13,
        "sha256": "da7be384bcaa42ddb7fe1501ceb260c1bf8636880d083a13e3eb05f8ca210e72"
      }
    ],
