    "termsHash": "a02edef68d281ebd82345bfd128fd1261850a37df5bc28db0aee338b86121c78",
    "selected": [
      {
        "id": "63b346e38fb991c2",
        "description": "So Moses decided to take a closer look. Suddenly God called to him from inside the burning bush, ‘Moses.’ ‘Here I am Lord,’ Moses replied. – Slide 3",
        "imageUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Moses_Burning_Bush/source-jpeg/03_FB_Moses_Burning_Bush_1024.jpg?1727958618",
        "thumbnailUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Moses_Burning_Bush/overview-thumbnails/03_FB_Moses_Burning_Bush_Thumbnail.jpg?1727958618",
        "path": "docs/illustrations/sabedoria-kids/moses-burning-bush/03.jpg",
        "sourceScene": 3,
        "sha256": "b782725f7bb664ec8cba8a8dac7bf5e7db309727a3d3f0cdbbeab0ea8d73118b"
      },
      {
        "id": "ac2e859e2aef46be",
        "description": "Exodus 3 Moses was looking after the flock of his father-in-law, Jethro. He led them to the far side of the wilderness to graze, by a mountain called Horeb. – Slide 1",
        "imageUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Moses_Burning_Bush/source-jpeg/01_FB_Moses_Burning_Bush_1024.jpg?1727958618",
        "thumbnailUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Moses_Burning_Bush/overview-thumbnails/01_FB_Moses_Burning_Bush_Thumbnail.jpg?1727958618",
        "path": "docs/illustrations/sabedoria-kids/moses-burning-bush/01.jpg",
        "sourceScene": 1,
        "sha256": "f753d86f98c1c851ee0be76bd0fcc9fdfa42f6d3f87b9ba2578544e9f12e2a79"
      },
      {
        "id": "0333ca77e758879e",
        "description": "He watched a bush that had caught fire and noticed it did not burn up. – Slide 2",
        "imageUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Moses_Burning_Bush/source-jpeg/02_FB_Moses_Burning_Bush_1024.jpg?1727958618",
        "thumbnailUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Moses_Burning_Bush/overview-thumbnails/02_FB_Moses_Burning_Bush_Thumbnail.jpg?1727958618",
        "path": "docs/illustrations/sabedoria-kids/moses-burning-bush/02.jpg",
        "sourceScene": 2,
        "sha256": "35832e0926b2ed98e1b099addf6f86b9bd16d4437ec1e6b70ec31f25e3a0ab30"
      },
      {
        "id": "908f7d1e84baa187",
        "description": "God told Moses to take off his shoes for he was on holy ground. ‘I am the God of Abraham, Isaac and Jacob,’ God announced. At this, Moses hid his face for he was afraid to look at God. – Slide 4",
        "imageUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Moses_Burning_Bush/source-jpeg/04_FB_Moses_Burning_Bush_1024.jpg?1727958618",
        "thumbnailUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Moses_Burning_Bush/overview-thumbnails/04_FB_Moses_Burning_Bush_Thumbnail.jpg?1727958618",
        "path": "docs/illustrations/sabedoria-kids/moses-burning-bush/04.jpg",
        "sourceScene": 4,
        "sha256": "6a1519294982691bdb3d188605dfd9370935f37ed045ecd3fd185e3b54b8f4a9"
      },
      {
        "id": "f72500458d28daa8",
        "description": "‘Go to Pharaoh and bring my people out of Egypt’, God instructed. Moses started making excuses. ‘Who am I to do this?’ – Slide 6",
        "imageUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Moses_Burning_Bush/source-jpeg/06_FB_Moses_Burning_Bush_1024.jpg?1727958618",
        "thumbnailUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Moses_Burning_Bush/overview-thumbnails/06_FB_Moses_Burning_Bush_Thumbnail.jpg?1727958618",
        "path": "docs/illustrations/sabedoria-kids/moses-burning-bush/06.jpg",
        "sourceScene": 6,
        "sha256": "c814ef1de0f927a79d6cc5bdcb9672f9386f250365b29a847796e0c0c026c713"
      },
      {
        "id": "edca4fc3429fa6f7",
        "description": "God promised to be with Moses. He also promised that He would make a way for the Hebrews to come and worship Him on this mountain. – Slide 7",
        "imageUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Moses_Burning_Bush/source-jpeg/07_FB_Moses_Burning_Bush_1024.jpg?1727958618",
        "thumbnailUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Moses_Burning_Bush/overview-thumbnails/07_FB_Moses_Burning_Bush_Thumbnail.jpg?1727958618",
        "path": "docs/illustrations/sabedoria-kids/moses-burning-bush/07.jpg",
        "sourceScene": 7,
        "sha256": "99ddc3e3941a4b52604a13d3b9f26513309556b4ab076f303c5176af1bcce755"
      }
    ],
