    "story": 10,
    "url": "https://www.freebibleimages.org/illustrations/jesus-resurrection/",
    "license": "CC BY-SA 3.0",
    "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/",
    "termsHash": "ac5dae004f62ce165e9ad4278627edace0314949d62be71c46f49893d651cdd4",
    "selected": [
      {
        "id": "e9e34b3aea027626",
        "description": "When the women arrived at the tomb they noticed the large stone covering the entrance had been rolled back. As they entered the tomb they saw the angel and were alarmed. – Slide 4",
        "imageUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Jesus_Resurrection/source-jpeg/04_FB_Jesus_Resurrection_1024.jpg?1724236419",
        "thumbnailUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Jesus_Resurrection/overview-thumbnails/04_FB_Jesus_Resurrection_Thumbnail.jpg?1724236419",
        "sourceScene": 4,
        "sha256": "84e78c4eff81535c925a99441258e1bebffaaff25498b7db2e0df01598a84806",
        "visualHash": "9d0d2765ccd578bc",
        "mirrorHash": "464f1b59cc54e1c2",
        "path": "docs/illustrations/sabedoria-kids/kids-biblia-32-auto/01-e9e34b3aea027626.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "6bb08fda40d87a56",
        "description": "‘Do not be afraid, for I know that you are looking for Jesus, who was crucified,’ the angel said. ‘He is not here, He has risen, just as He said. Come and see the place where He lay. – Slide 5",
        "imageUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Jesus_Resurrection/source-jpeg/05_FB_Jesus_Resurrection_1024.jpg?1724236419",
        "thumbnailUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Jesus_Resurrection/overview-thumbnails/05_FB_Jesus_Resurrection_Thumbnail.jpg?1724236419",
        "sourceScene": 5,
        "sha256": "f9a717f64046ff623ed21096be046c2a9694cb72eb68ccb02c809d7c5b291a0d",
        "visualHash": "151767654da9616d",
        "mirrorHash": "071719594d6a7949",
        "path": "docs/illustrations/sabedoria-kids/kids-biblia-32-auto/02-6bb08fda40d87a56.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "4783227a17e2ea0b",
        "description": "Suddenly Jesus met them. ‘Greetings,’ He said. They came closer to him, clasped His feet and worshipped Him. ‘Do not be afraid,’ Jesus told them. ‘Go and tell my brothers to go to Galilee and they will see me there.’ – Slide 8",
        "imageUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Jesus_Resurrection/source-jpeg/08_FB_Jesus_Resurrection_1024.jpg?1724236419",
        "thumbnailUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Jesus_Resurrection/overview-thumbnails/08_FB_Jesus_Resurrection_Thumbnail.jpg?1724236419",
        "sourceScene": 8,
        "sha256": "1ba1c4aa248e98b467291186e56574c6bbfdd381cfe29c3c8b99a1f7ff639ad9",
        "visualHash": "0c24c98a06cf4606",
        "mirrorHash": "cfd16cae9f0c9d9f",
        "path": "docs/illustrations/sabedoria-kids/kids-biblia-32-auto/03-4783227a17e2ea0b.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "86d0039fd8c63c00",
        "description": "The women rushed off to tell the disciples Jesus was alive. But the disciples did not believe them. Peter and John ran to the tomb to see what had happened. – Slide 9",
        "imageUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Jesus_Resurrection/source-jpeg/09_FB_Jesus_Resurrection_1024.jpg?1724236419",
        "thumbnailUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Jesus_Resurrection/overview-thumbnails/09_FB_Jesus_Resurrection_Thumbnail.jpg?1724236419",
        "sourceScene": 9,
        "sha256": "dcdfb96fcc965b18220753d7d4dcc251c8ac6270debb43b364f74e01a81e5706",
        "visualHash": "61599363c3d62e36",
        "mirrorHash": "796536393c948b93",
        "path": "docs/illustrations/sabedoria-kids/kids-biblia-32-auto/04-86d0039fd8c63c00.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "857e0d24eb4f439e",
        "description": "He also saw the strips of linen lying there, and the cloth that had been wrapped round Jesus’ head. The cloth was still lying in its place, separate from the linen. Peter was puzzled and wondered what had happened. He did not understand from the scriptures that it was God’s plan for Jesus, the Messiah, to suffer, die and then be raised to life. – Slide 11",
        "imageUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Jesus_Resurrection/source-jpeg/11_FB_Jesus_Resurrection_1024.jpg?1724236419",
        "thumbnailUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Jesus_Resurrection/overview-thumbnails/11_FB_Jesus_Resurrection_Thumbnail.jpg?1724236419",
        "sourceScene": 11,
        "sha256": "1c0ea04d6d94660281a0fe3c68d0d8acfb00a3854d944b779555e48731a79dc9",
        "visualHash": "97919a9b84243439",
        "mirrorHash": "1676a626dedbd363",
        "path": "docs/illustrations/sabedoria-kids/kids-biblia-32-auto/05-857e0d24eb4f439e.jpg"
      },
      {
        "id": "2c95420919057f00",
        "description": "John arrived first and stared into the empty tomb. He saw strips of linen lying there but did not go in. Simon Peter caught up and went straight into the tomb. – Slide 10",
        "imageUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Jesus_Resurrection/source-jpeg/10_FB_Jesus_Resurrection_1024.jpg?1724236419",
        "thumbnailUrl": "https://media.freebibleimages.org/stories/FB_Jesus_Resurrection/overview-thumbnails/10_FB_Jesus_Resurrection_Thumbnail.jpg?1724236419",
        "sourceScene": 10,
